    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Libisulo khulsaye, nende omulangokwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumuyika okwa omuruchi Uzia yafwilamwo, ndalola Omwami niyeekhaale ikhushifumbi shiobwami, hekulu aheechinOu, emikhanda chiebiifwalobie nichiitsula muhekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaserafi basinjila hekuluwe; shia mulala yali nende tsimbaha tsisasaba; tsibili yeefuunikha mumoni, tsibili yeefuunikha ebilenie, natsibili yapulushila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwo omuse kwemiliango nikutechesibwa khulwa omwoyo kwa oyo owalanga, inzu yosi niyiitsulamwo omwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ndasunga mbu Woowe! Kho isie embweelel shichila endi omundu womunwa kweshifwabwi, khandi emenyanga hakari wabandu beminwa chieshirwabwi; okhuba tsimoni tsianje tsiluutsi Omuruchi, OMWAMI omwene mahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mulala khubaserafi abo yapulukha niyanzitsila, nali nende elianda eliang'alaale mumukhono, elia yali nayiniye khushimalilo nende lihana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nalitsiina khumunwa kwanje, naboola mbu Lola, lino litsiinilwe khumunwakwo; obumayaanubwo buyiniibwe, obwonoonibwo nabwo butisilwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
